  "prefLabel": "Med 105.02 Necessary Quorum",
  "priorExpiration": "1996-11-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Med 105.02 Necessary Quorum. Except as otherwise provided by law, a quorum shall not be required to conduct a hearing or receive information, but final decisions shall be made only by the affirmative vote of a majority of the board members eligible to participate in the matter in question.\n\nSource. #4970, eff 11-8-90, EXPIRED 11-8-96\n\nNew. #6554, eff 7-31-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/med100-600.html"
}
